flanger triangular-sweep flanger (src/audio/flanger.ts)

src/audio/flanger.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_flanger.c: the delay, depth,
regen, width, speed, shape, phase and interp options with their native ranges
and shorthand order, init()'s /100 and /1000 scaling and gain formulas,
config_input()'s (int) max_samples and lfo_length, the FILTER_SINGLE_SAMPLEFMT
(dblp) format, and filter_frame()'s per-channel delay ring, delay_last
feedback, shared delay_buf_pos and lfo_pos, channel phase offset, modf
fractional delay and linear/quadratic interpolation. It also adapts the
WAVE_TRI branch of libavfilter/generate_wave_table.c (ff_generate_wave_table
into a float table at phase 3*pi/2).

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
